From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:26:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 187/194] glm: TF_GLM_KV_SPLIT, each token's latent rows (and
 with 2 its index keys) on one rank

Decode windows: queries all-gathered, each rank attends its own keys for every head, partials merged by
log-sum-exp at the head's owner. Prompt chunks: history gathered into a whole-layer scratch, the unchanged
block attends (bit-identical). TF_GLM_KV_SPLIT=2: per-rank index scores and top-2048, candidates merged
exactly (tf_glm_dsa_topk's picks and order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UQVvNktFCvQrvpNUbqtqBX
